OL,3,AMariska Hargitay hosts TV's biggest
OL,4,Anight as the 78th Emmy Awards are under
OL,5,Away
OL,6,
OL,7,FLaw & Order star Mariska Hargitay hosts
OL,8,FTV's biggest night, the 78th Primetime
OL,9,FEmmy Awards, and opens the show with a
OL,10,Fcelebrity-filled musical number
OL,12,FStars including Zendaya and Nicole
OL,13,FKidman to Colman Domingo and Matthew
OL,14,FRhys turn heads on the red carpet at
OL,15,Fthe Peacock Theater in Downtown Los
OL,16,FAngeles. See all the looks here
OL,18,FLeading the pack in nominations is
OL,19,Fmedical drama The Pitt, which is up for
OL,20,F25 awards - read more about the show
OL,21,Fhere
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
